ost 40 years he would be  the kind of person who would who would  do whatever he could to help in a  situation like like that that's Jerry  he's just a wonderful person here at the  synagogue yesterday the president was  asked if he had anything to say and he  said quote sad sad very sad I hope we've  learned a lot  Gayle of all the posters being held up  around here there was one that I loved  and I know you'll love it said quote  hate cannot weaken a city of Steel David  Beck know very well said thank you very  much and we need messages like that  today
 

